        <mxCell id="final-resolution" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="Export Excel: preserve EVERY original column and cell value, including CSV &lt;font color=&quot;#26a69a&quot;&gt;&quot;Function or Status Code&quot;&lt;/font&gt; and &lt;font color=&quot;#26a69a&quot;&gt;&quot;point name (without function code)&quot;&lt;/font&gt;. ADD result columns only.&lt;br&gt;Add &lt;font color=&quot;#26a69a&quot;&gt;&quot;Appendix_b&quot;&lt;/font&gt; T/F, &lt;font color=&quot;#ab47bc&quot;&gt;&quot;enm_semantic_schema&quot;&lt;/font&gt; T/F, final result, derived codes, candidate mappings and review reasons.&lt;br&gt;BLUE &amp;gt; YELLOW &amp;gt; normal GREEN / RED.&lt;br&gt;Do not overwrite source data with derived or corrected values; leave unresolved NEW result values blank." vertex="1">
